   470 				; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   471 				; bk_draw_two - Redraw only the rows for bk_old_sel and bk_sel.
   472 				; Selection moves repaint 2 rows instead of all 10 (5x less VRAM work
   473 				; per keypress — snappier cursor in the list).
