   246 				; img_read_pixels - Stream pixel data into VBXE VRAM via MEMAC B
   247 				; Reads chunks from FujiNet, writes each to VRAM via vbxe_img_write_chunk
   248 				; Stops on: EOF (error 136), disconnect, timeout, user abort, or read error
   249 				; Output: C=0 ok (image complete or partial), C=1 error
