   408 				; img_fetch_single - Fetch and display a single image from img_src_buf
   409 				; Called from: ui_follow_link (main menu), render_page_pause (--More-- prompt),
   410 				;             http_download (deferred after page download closes N1:)
   411 				; Flow: save url → resolve → OPEN N1: → header → alloc → palette → pixels →
